            </p>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
              Our evolution reflects our commitment to innovation and expanding impact. In 2011, we established our state-of-the-art processing facility in Burayu town, Oromia Region—just 15 km west of Addis Ababa—strategically located in the highlands for ideal food processing conditions. We commenced operations with advanced American and European sesame seed hulling and roasting technology, specifically the premium Humera variety with exceptional oil content and creamy color. Today, our facility processes up to 20 MT of sesame per day with 99.95% purity while maintaining ISO 22000 certification and organic standards.
            </p>
            <p class="leading-relaxed">
